{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey your way high and low, far and wide, just for the heck of it. Meet weirdos along the way. Explode things. Explode them good. It's a super quirky semi-retro platform-adventure. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pretty pixels for your eyeballs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whimsical music-sounds for your ear-holes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional one-button control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable input.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several hours of gameplay on first play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silly writing. Cute n' quirky characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An instruction booklet, like the good ol' days.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly: Adventure.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Default Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow keys to change direction. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z for jump/confirm and other actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X for &quot;back&quot; in menu.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I just wanted to say Hi and that I think you're doin' great :)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/448500/9416f9863b92816c3ef5229904191abdf035d955.jpg"},{"name":"Talker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/448500/63bbbd249b8805c97da4d7dfc2a5b718d1de1e26.jpg"},{"name":"Straight up murder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/448500/f39806491e8e6ad42164ecad492694acde629834.jpg"},{"name":"Harvester of souls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/448500/7b53289dd3659facb762793a62c4fc31caa0a540.jpg"},{"name":"Let it be","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamsta